--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f392510f32186a740ab579272878b571, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 39477317632
    m_Localized: ...zzzz bzzzt.. Hey! You! Awake?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900544
    m_Localized: Glad you opened your eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900545
    m_Localized: You were staring blankly out of the screen, I thought the system
      crashed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900546
    m_Localized: I'm the dealer who 'manages' the scores around here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900547
    m_Localized: You just need to bounce the ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900548
    m_Localized: I'll take care of the scores.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900549
    m_Localized: Don't you know the rules here? No matter how many points you score,
      without my 'approval', it's just zero.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900550
    m_Localized: So... let's secure a little cut for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900551
    m_Localized: Well, if you feel it's unfair... try reaching Round 3 here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900552
    m_Localized: Then I'll give you the 'full amount'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900553
    m_Localized: No time! Click anywhere on the [Screen] to start!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900554
    m_Localized: Don't forget, pressing the Spacebar launches the ball!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900555
    m_Localized: Oh~ Not bad. You got fast fingers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900556
    m_Localized: Good, good! This is enough to cover the first fee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900557
    m_Localized: What? You cleared... up to Round 2?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900558
    m_Localized: ...Hmm. How did you... do that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900559
    m_Localized: Now, now! The final Round 3! (You'll never beat this)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900560
    m_Localized: '!! You... beat Round 3?! No way!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900561
    m_Localized: You actually broke the machine! The system is collapsing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900562
    m_Localized: Damn it! My money!!!! My cut!!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900563
    m_Localized: Ah... no time for this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900564
    m_Localized: I forgot I had a data transfer part-time job~~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900565
    m_Localized: Peace out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900566
    m_Localized: Oops. Oh my... it's 'GAME OVER'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900567
    m_Localized: What a shame, what a shame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900568
    m_Localized: You were moving your fingers so flashily... ran out of energy at
      the end?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900569
    m_Localized: It's okay, it's okay. ... My money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900570
    m_Localized: I mean, I'll keep the entry fee safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39489900571
    m_Localized: I'll give you one more chance to restore your 'honor'!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39494094848
    m_Localized: Bring it on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
